# Multiple $_ at different nesting levels.
# [call $map [call $+ $_ 10] [0: 1 1: 2 2: 3]]
# Inner call [call $+ $_ 10] has DIRECT $_ arg → wraps to [fn [_] [call $+ $_ 10]]
# Outer call passes that wrapped function to $map.
# Result: each value has 10 added: 1+10=11, 2+10=12, 3+10=13
[map [+ _ 10] [0: 1 1: 2 2: 3]]
===
Dict({0: Int(11), 1: Int(12), 2: Int(13)})
